INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (183,1,'2024-09-19 20:23:39','2024-09-19 20:23:39','<img src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n			<h2>A Home For Riders From All Walks Of Life Without Discrimination</h2>		\n													<img src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n		<p>Known by its acronym, L.A.M.A. is a club without borders, a “Humanist Association” that accepts working people from all walks of life as members without discrimination based on nationality, race, color, religion, social class, gender, age, motorcycle brand, etc.</p><p> </p><p>L.A.M.A. Chicago was the sole chapter for 19 years until, in 1996, its first sister chapter was born in Miami and the group elected a National President. In 2000, L.A.M.A. celebrated the Millenium by going global, creating L.A.M.A. International Motorcycle Association (I.M.A.) with the addition of chapters in Puerto Rico, Mexico and Cuba. </p><p>L.A.M.A. continued to expand in 2006 when it introduced Moto-Touring. Moto-Touring is an adventure sport that challenges participants to ride extreme distances, logging miles as they go. L.A.M.A. holds Regional, National, Continental, and World Championships for Moto-Touring, giving members the chance to meet L.A.M.A.s in lands near and far.</p>		\n													<img src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n													<img src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n		<p style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;\">Finally, Damas de L.A.M.A. (the ladies of L.A.M.A.) is an important part of the Latin American Motorcycle Association. Their motto: “We Ride Our Own”. Most motorcyclists find traveling extreme distances to be difficult but L.A.M.A. men and women perform these rides often, and they would have it no other way!</p><p style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;\"> </p><p style=\"margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;\">L.A.M.A./I.M.A. abide by statutes and regulations, and value clear association guidelines internationally. </p>		\n			<a href=\"#\">\n									Join Us!\n					</a>\n			<h2>Discover all L.A.M.A. has to offer!<br>\nTake some time to browse the website and reach out with any questions.</h2>','Contact','','inherit','closed','closed','','44-revision-v1','','','2024-09-19 20:23:39','2024-09-19 20:23:39','',44,'http://lama.local/?p=183',0,'revision','',0);
