t Table\" data-src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Ecuador-Banquet-Table-qv8c6xxbwu6ypo3mjbel91rhqf31xzrd7tk0tfqz2o.jpg\" /></figure>\r\n<figure><img alt=\"Ecuador Championship Logo\" data-src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Ecuador-Championship-Logo-150x150.jpg\" /></figure>\r\n<figure><img alt=\"Great shot in front of Orlando IMA banner\" data-src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Great-shot-in-front-of-Orlando-IMA-banner-qv8c70quhcatohzj2umgyj1vikp5l32k87ih2nhekw.jpg\" /></figure>\r\n<figure><img alt=\"IMA Ecuador in front of banner - Closeup\" data-src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/IMA-Ecuador-in-front-of-banner-Closeup-qv8c73kd1ueonbvfmduco0c9aqb986dr8lgxvpo00g.jpg\" /></figure>\r\n<figure><img alt=\"IMA Ecuador in front of banner\" data-src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/IMA-Ecuador-in-front-of-banner-qv8c75g1fih9ajspbenlszv6hi1znkl7wurwmlc2z4.jpg\" /></figure>\r\n<figure><img alt=\"Stephany Marrero 1st\" data-src=\"http://lama.local/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Stephany-Marrero-1st-qv8c789k00l49doluxvhih5k9no3anwex8qd2f7wgg.jpg\" /></figure>\r\n&nbsp;','L.A.M.A. Station','','inherit','closed','closed','','754-revision-v1','','','2024-10-08 00:14:59','2024-10-08 00:14:59','',754,'http://lama.local/?p=760',0,'revision','',0);
